WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
If you already know the market, say so.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
These were hidden until now, on purpose.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
An option you cannot judge yet just looks like complexity.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Name the rivals yourself.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:28.000
It skips working out who competes with you and goes straight to reading them.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Or paste one website.

7
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.200
It reads that company, works out the market, and finds the others itself.

8
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.200
Or both at once, in one sentence.

9
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:49.600
The same report either way. One question. Now try it yourself.
